WEBVTT

01:30.390 --> 01:34.950
[The Heir]

01:35.320 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 21]

01:38.039 --> 01:38.920
Manager Shao,

01:39.200 --> 01:40.870
when are the delivery dates?

01:40.920 --> 01:42.070
Is there still time to remake them?

01:42.070 --> 01:43.509
Most of them are due soon.

01:43.590 --> 01:45.590
The earliest order is due tomorrow.

01:45.590 --> 01:46.350
Tomorrow?

01:48.560 --> 01:50.759
I have only managed household affairs,

01:50.789 --> 01:53.000
without knowing anything about business.

01:53.000 --> 01:54.800
Regarding the ink orders, Zhen,

01:55.200 --> 01:56.860
what do you think we should do?

01:57.680 --> 02:00.040
I saw Doggie and the others
sort out some boxes of ink sticks

02:00.040 --> 02:01.070
that hadn't been burned by the fire.

02:01.070 --> 02:03.120
They are perfectly intact inside and out.

02:03.120 --> 02:04.120
Should we use them

02:04.120 --> 02:05.430
to fulfill tomorrow's order first?

02:05.430 --> 02:06.070
No.

02:06.510 --> 02:07.950
Once exposed to high heat,

02:07.950 --> 02:09.000
the ink can crack easily.

02:09.000 --> 02:10.400
It might look intact on the surface,

02:10.400 --> 02:11.710
but it's actually unusable.

02:11.710 --> 02:13.870
Our Li Ink can lose anything,

02:14.000 --> 02:15.520
but not our reputation.

02:16.280 --> 02:17.710
Manager Zhen, you're right.

02:17.710 --> 02:19.910
I was anxious and didn't think it through.

02:19.910 --> 02:21.190
For these recent ink orders,

02:21.190 --> 02:22.840
follow the contracts

02:22.960 --> 02:24.520
and pay the penalty in full.

02:24.630 --> 02:25.710
Also, Manager Shao,

02:25.710 --> 02:28.590
please help me arrange a meeting
with the ink merchants.

02:28.590 --> 02:29.920
Let's discuss with them

02:30.150 --> 02:31.520
whether we can give up 30% of the profit

02:31.520 --> 02:33.560
to delay the delivery dates

02:33.560 --> 02:34.870
for a few days.

02:35.030 --> 02:35.590
Okay.

02:36.240 --> 02:36.840
I got it.

02:37.680 --> 02:39.310
How is everything going
at the ink workshop?

02:39.310 --> 02:40.329
Besides the smoke shed,

02:40.329 --> 02:42.150
is there any damage elsewhere?

02:42.150 --> 02:43.720
Besides the smoke shed and warehouse,

02:43.720 --> 02:45.720
the rest isn't seriously damaged.

02:45.800 --> 02:48.260
It should be usable
with some minor repairs.

02:48.520 --> 02:49.360
That's good.

02:52.240 --> 02:53.030
Eldest Aunt,

02:53.360 --> 02:56.310
I once learned ink-making for 3 years
at the Li family's old ink workshop.

02:56.310 --> 02:57.520
It might be decrepit,

02:57.520 --> 02:58.850
but it still works fine.

02:59.480 --> 03:01.650
Before the smoke shed is repaired,

03:02.120 --> 03:04.850
let's move
the lampblack-making process there.

03:05.360 --> 03:06.560
That's not a problem.

03:06.870 --> 03:07.960
It's just that...

03:09.240 --> 03:10.240
Just what?

03:10.470 --> 03:12.710
It's just that the upcoming deliveries are
all large ink orders.

03:12.710 --> 03:14.470
There are
about 10,000 ink sticks in total.

03:14.470 --> 03:15.770
If we compensate them all,

03:15.770 --> 03:17.930
the funds on the ink workshop's books

03:17.960 --> 03:19.760
are far from enough, I'm afraid.

03:21.710 --> 03:23.120
With my previous wages

03:23.240 --> 03:24.860
and the revenue
from the New Li Ink Workshop

03:24.860 --> 03:25.740
combined,

03:26.150 --> 03:27.560
there should be 500 taels of silver.

03:27.560 --> 03:28.430
Take it for now.

03:28.430 --> 03:30.290
I'll figure out a way for the rest.

03:30.710 --> 03:31.910
I still have my dowry.

03:33.079 --> 03:34.840
If I take out my entire dowry,

03:35.030 --> 03:36.960
it'll cover 1,000 taels of silver.

03:37.240 --> 03:38.079
Eldest Aunt.

03:38.120 --> 03:40.520
Eldest Young Lady, how can we do this?

03:40.540 --> 03:41.490
A woman's dowry

03:41.510 --> 03:43.100
is her lifeblood.

03:43.240 --> 03:44.430
Zhen is right.

03:44.500 --> 03:46.300
Our Li family can lose anything,

03:46.710 --> 03:48.910
except for the reputation of Li Ink.

03:50.800 --> 03:53.430
We won't short them a single penny
of the compensation we owe.

03:53.430 --> 03:54.690
Follow the contracts.

03:55.280 --> 03:56.470
At a time like this,

03:56.960 --> 03:59.470
we must work together to pull through.

04:00.470 --> 04:01.310
Eldest Aunt,

04:01.960 --> 04:04.080
Li Ink will surely
get through this crisis.

04:04.080 --> 04:05.240
I promise you

04:05.470 --> 04:06.470
I will definitely

04:06.630 --> 04:08.310
earn back your dowry, Eldest Aunt,

04:08.310 --> 04:10.110
without a single penny missing.

04:11.910 --> 04:13.310
I believe in you.

04:13.590 --> 04:16.790
This whole thing started
because of us, the Sixth Branch.

04:17.310 --> 04:19.950
So, of course, we should cover part of it.

04:20.800 --> 04:21.680
Third Aunt.

04:23.720 --> 04:24.650
Sister-in-law,

04:25.510 --> 04:27.280
are you distancing yourselves from us,
the Sixth Branch,

04:27.280 --> 04:29.070
because of Jingdong's mistake?

04:29.070 --> 04:30.270
Why did you keep

04:30.720 --> 04:32.320
such a serious issue from us?

04:32.890 --> 04:34.420
Ying is right.

04:36.870 --> 04:38.830
We bear unforgivable blame for this.

04:38.830 --> 04:40.310
Even if we have to pay compensation,

04:40.310 --> 04:42.310
we should be the ones to pay it first.

04:44.120 --> 04:45.720
You have all misunderstood.

04:46.680 --> 04:48.540
Given Jingdong's current state,

04:48.560 --> 04:49.950
how could I, as your sister-in-law,

04:49.950 --> 04:51.950
cause you any more trouble?

04:52.040 --> 04:53.830
You've got that wrong, Eldest Aunt.

04:53.830 --> 04:55.159
We are a family.

04:55.240 --> 04:56.680
Now that Li Ink is in trouble,

04:56.680 --> 04:58.190
we should face it together.

04:58.190 --> 05:00.520
There is no such thing as causing trouble.

05:01.190 --> 05:02.120
Sister-in-law,

05:02.240 --> 05:04.190
my dowry isn't as substantial as yours,

05:04.190 --> 05:05.000
but

05:05.000 --> 05:07.660
if I add up the jewelry I've saved
over the years,

05:08.430 --> 05:09.950
it should be worth
a few hundred taels of silver.

05:09.950 --> 05:10.870
Early tomorrow morning,

05:10.870 --> 05:13.270
I will tally up the revenue
from the estate.

05:13.430 --> 05:16.560
It should be around a few hundred taels
of silver as well.

05:17.190 --> 05:18.120
I have some, too.

05:19.630 --> 05:20.560
Unfortunately,

05:20.950 --> 05:23.010
I spent it all on pills and talismans.

05:23.170 --> 05:25.360
I-I will sell them all tomorrow.

05:25.360 --> 05:27.820
That should fetch
about 100 taels of silver.

05:31.560 --> 05:33.750
Manager Shao, please calculate it.

05:33.750 --> 05:35.070
Is this enough now?

05:35.360 --> 05:36.420
It's about enough.

05:36.630 --> 05:37.680
Probably enough.

05:38.800 --> 05:39.750
Great.

05:40.510 --> 05:41.510
Wonderful.

05:45.270 --> 05:46.430
Give this

05:47.720 --> 05:48.780
to Shao An.

05:51.040 --> 05:51.830
Okay.

05:51.920 --> 05:53.050
Thank you, Grandpa.

05:54.920 --> 05:55.560
Mother?

05:56.510 --> 05:57.190
Zhen.

05:59.070 --> 06:00.400
Send this to him as well.

06:00.830 --> 06:03.960
Over the years,
I've held a grudge against the Li family.

06:04.510 --> 06:05.640
But the Li family is,

06:05.680 --> 06:08.610
after all, the roots
of your father and grandfather.

06:09.480 --> 06:11.940
Besides, since I married
into the Li family,

06:11.950 --> 06:14.360
your Seventh Grandmother
has treated me well.

06:14.360 --> 06:16.680
I must return this favor.

06:23.160 --> 06:24.240
You've waited for me this long.

06:24.240 --> 06:26.570
You must have something to tell me, right?

06:27.430 --> 06:29.760
I heard about the fire
at the ink workshop.

06:29.920 --> 06:32.150
And those merchants who signed contracts

06:32.150 --> 06:33.680
and placed ink orders

06:34.040 --> 06:37.240
are making a scene,
demanding an explanation from Li Ink.

06:37.270 --> 06:40.420
And Zhen, now that you've taken over
the position of its manager,

06:40.420 --> 06:43.620
it seems that you can't avoid
dealing with the whole mess.

06:43.950 --> 06:45.610
Thank you for telling me that.

06:46.680 --> 06:48.190
But besides this,

06:48.390 --> 06:51.450
you actually
want to talk about something else, right?

06:52.120 --> 06:53.040
You want

06:54.310 --> 06:55.710
to withdraw your shares.

06:57.480 --> 07:00.070
Why do you always assume
that I want to withdraw my shares?

07:00.070 --> 07:01.950
Instead of withdrawing,
I'm indeed adding more.

07:01.950 --> 07:04.120
I call this taking advantage of a crisis

07:04.120 --> 07:06.600
to increase my investment
in the Li family.

07:09.480 --> 07:11.280
You have already helped me a lot.

07:11.750 --> 07:13.240
I can't owe you anymore.

07:14.750 --> 07:16.190
What do you mean by owing?

07:16.190 --> 07:18.680
I told you,
I'm taking advantage of a crisis.

07:18.680 --> 07:20.480
Come on, do you think I'm a fool?

07:21.270 --> 07:22.310
You think if you put it that way,

07:22.310 --> 07:24.160
I'll feel at ease accepting it?

07:26.560 --> 07:27.240
Zhen,

07:27.830 --> 07:30.760
since I chose to cooperate
with you and the Li family,

07:31.070 --> 07:31.750
of course,

07:32.870 --> 07:34.470
I am willing to add more funds

07:34.560 --> 07:36.890
to help Li Ink tide over the difficulties.

07:39.190 --> 07:40.750
Thank you for your kindness, Master Qi.

07:40.750 --> 07:41.830
But in the end,

07:41.830 --> 07:44.760
this is an internal matter
for the Li family to solve.

07:45.800 --> 07:47.060
So I won't trouble you.

07:51.190 --> 07:51.750
Alright.

07:53.240 --> 07:55.570
Then just let me know
if anything comes up.

08:05.190 --> 08:07.250
Eldest Young Lady, Third Young Lady.

08:07.390 --> 08:08.190
Manager Shao,

08:08.240 --> 08:10.240
have those ink merchants
who caused trouble been dealt with?

08:10.240 --> 08:11.480
It's all settled.

08:11.890 --> 08:13.750
Thanks to Manager Zhen's advance planning,

08:13.750 --> 08:15.780
before those head managers
could even make a fuss,

08:15.780 --> 08:17.830
they received their full compensation.

08:17.830 --> 08:18.560
As they left,

08:18.560 --> 08:21.560
they kept praising Li Ink's staff
for being considerate,

08:21.560 --> 08:23.240
ethical, and trustworthy.

08:23.430 --> 08:25.430
They said
once the ink workshop is fully repaired,

08:25.430 --> 08:27.760
they'd come back to place more ink orders.

08:28.870 --> 08:30.040
Manager Shao!

08:30.700 --> 08:31.540
Manager Zhen.

08:31.750 --> 08:33.669
You are really fast on your feet.

08:33.870 --> 08:36.669
I couldn't keep up with you,
even though I hurried.

08:36.669 --> 08:37.270
Look at me.

08:37.360 --> 08:39.030
I just wanted to report
the good news as soon as possible.

08:39.030 --> 08:39.750
Excuse my manners.

08:39.750 --> 08:41.630
It's fine. I'm just teasing you.

08:42.440 --> 08:44.030
Eldest Aunt, Third Aunt.

08:44.150 --> 08:46.210
Eldest Young Lady, Third Young Lady,

08:46.550 --> 08:48.610
Lord Yan sent someone with a message.

08:48.790 --> 08:49.720
Masters,

08:50.200 --> 08:51.960
the Tribute Ink selection is approaching.

08:51.960 --> 08:53.840
Lord Yan has decided that in 2 days,

08:53.840 --> 08:56.060
the ink worship ceremony
will be held by the Xin'an River.

08:55.240 --> 08:55.920
[To Li Ink Workshop,
the Tribute Ink selection is near.]

08:55.920 --> 08:56.600
[The ink worship ceremony
will be held by Xin'an River in 2 days.]

08:56.320 --> 08:59.120
All participating ink workshops are
requested to arrive on time for it

08:56.600 --> 08:58.110
[All participating ink workshops are
requested to arrive on time for it.]

08:59.120 --> 09:01.030
and submit their participation document.

09:01.030 --> 09:02.230
Those who arrive late

09:02.310 --> 09:05.310
will be disqualified
from the Tribute Ink selection.

09:05.840 --> 09:06.550
Thank you.

09:06.720 --> 09:08.320
Mr. Zhou, please see him out.

09:08.670 --> 09:09.670
This way, please.

09:14.080 --> 09:14.870
Zhen.

09:16.440 --> 09:18.240
You are now the manager of Li Ink.

09:18.440 --> 09:20.000
You should be the one to decide.

09:20.000 --> 09:22.260
Eldest Aunt, regarding the Tribute Ink,

09:22.340 --> 09:24.270
it involves
Uncle Jingdong's painstaking effort.

09:24.270 --> 09:25.870
Let's wait until he wakes up.

09:26.320 --> 09:27.000
Mother!

09:27.120 --> 09:29.270
Father is awake! He is awake!

09:32.000 --> 09:33.600
Father, you're awake!

09:34.600 --> 09:35.320
Jingdong.

09:36.790 --> 09:37.790
Be careful.

09:44.000 --> 09:44.510
Take it easy.

09:44.510 --> 09:46.320
Jingdong, you're finally awake.

09:46.320 --> 09:48.080
You really scared everyone!

09:48.490 --> 09:50.090
It's good that you're awake.

09:55.190 --> 09:56.740
Why did you save me?

10:00.480 --> 10:02.270
Why did you save me?

10:05.360 --> 10:07.200
Why did you save me?

10:07.200 --> 10:07.550
Father!

10:07.550 --> 10:08.870
Jingdong, what are you doing?

10:08.870 --> 10:09.440
Go away!

10:09.440 --> 10:10.550
What are you doing?

10:10.550 --> 10:11.630
Let me die!

10:11.630 --> 10:12.230
Jingdong!

10:12.440 --> 10:12.910
Master!

10:12.910 --> 10:13.600
Let me die!

10:13.600 --> 10:14.120
Father!

10:14.120 --> 10:15.240
Can you stop messing around?

10:15.240 --> 10:16.550
Let me die!

10:16.550 --> 10:17.600
-Father!
-Jingdong!

10:17.600 --> 10:19.600
Let me die!

10:19.620 --> 10:21.910
If you die, what will Zhengshen and I do?

10:23.110 --> 10:24.830
I don't deserve to live.

10:26.670 --> 10:28.670
Why did you save...

10:30.290 --> 10:31.290
Go away!

10:31.320 --> 10:31.720
Jingdong!

10:31.720 --> 10:33.240
Let me die!

10:33.270 --> 10:34.080
Zhengshen!

10:34.550 --> 10:35.510
Carry your father

10:35.510 --> 10:36.440
and come with me!

10:36.480 --> 10:38.120
Zhen, what are you going to do?

10:38.120 --> 10:39.150
Doesn't he want to die?

10:39.150 --> 10:39.790
Fine.

10:39.840 --> 10:41.840
I'll find him a good place to die.

10:42.080 --> 10:42.630
What...

10:42.870 --> 10:43.670
Carry him!

10:44.030 --> 10:45.440
Let me go!

10:45.460 --> 10:46.980
Where are you taking me?

10:47.630 --> 10:49.960
Zhengshen, put your father here.

10:51.000 --> 10:51.730
Put him down.

10:55.000 --> 10:55.640
Father.

11:03.550 --> 11:04.480
Zhen,

11:05.640 --> 11:08.170
why did you bring me here?

11:08.360 --> 11:10.020
Aren't you determined to die?

11:10.480 --> 11:11.200
Fine!

11:11.480 --> 11:12.240
Today,

11:12.440 --> 11:13.790
in front of the Sixth Master,

11:13.790 --> 11:15.670
smash your head against this coffin
and die.

11:15.670 --> 11:16.600
I promise

11:16.890 --> 11:18.420
no one will dare to stop you.

11:19.080 --> 11:20.880
The Sixth Master died for Li Ink.

11:21.120 --> 11:24.150
Even before he died,
he still cared about the family's honor.

11:24.150 --> 11:25.120
Today,

11:25.360 --> 11:27.080
I'll let him see clearly

11:27.360 --> 11:29.480
how the son
he sacrificed his life to protect

11:29.480 --> 11:31.600
gives up over a little setback

11:31.630 --> 11:34.630
and attempts suicide
over personal gains and losses!

11:34.870 --> 11:36.030
But before you die,

11:36.600 --> 11:38.030
you must know one thing.

11:39.750 --> 11:41.150
The fire you set

11:41.480 --> 11:43.340
burned everything to the ground.

11:43.720 --> 11:46.120
You burned
more than half of the warehouse!

11:46.720 --> 11:49.750
None of the ink orders
the Li family took can be delivered.

11:49.750 --> 11:50.670
Do you know

11:51.200 --> 11:53.630
where we got the compensation money?

11:53.910 --> 11:56.150
We got it from the dowries of Eldest Aunt
and Third Aunt,

11:56.150 --> 11:58.080
Aunt Chunhua's estate revenue,

11:58.720 --> 12:00.440
New Li Ink Workshop's income,

12:00.960 --> 12:02.890
Manager Shao's half-year salary,

12:03.320 --> 12:05.000
and the personal savings
of my grandfather and mother.

12:05.000 --> 12:06.240
Even Zhengshen

12:06.910 --> 12:09.080
sold his precious golden pills

12:09.080 --> 12:10.120
and talismans!

12:10.480 --> 12:12.360
The whole family barely

12:12.380 --> 12:14.500
scraped together enough money.

12:16.200 --> 12:18.150
Li Ink's century-old foundation

12:19.200 --> 12:21.750
was almost reduced to ashes by a fire.

12:22.200 --> 12:23.730
But in the entire Li family,

12:24.080 --> 12:26.280
from the Sixth Master who died for Li Ink

12:26.750 --> 12:28.360
to everyone who's given it their all

12:28.360 --> 12:30.770
and supported each other
through hard times,

12:30.770 --> 12:32.370
no one is a coward!

12:32.510 --> 12:33.840
Only you, Li Jingdong,

12:34.390 --> 12:36.720
gave up easily over a minor setback

12:36.720 --> 12:38.980
and tried to escape it all through death.

12:39.240 --> 12:40.360
You're a coward.

12:40.360 --> 12:41.790
You are so weak!

12:47.860 --> 12:49.860
You think death can end all the pain.

12:50.000 --> 12:52.390
But have you ever
thought about your family?

12:52.390 --> 12:53.510
Your wife

12:53.870 --> 12:55.030
and your son,

12:55.080 --> 12:56.480
what should they do?

12:57.270 --> 12:58.600
Third Aunt has been

12:58.870 --> 13:00.670
crying every day because of you.

13:00.670 --> 13:01.910
Zhengshen rushed

13:01.910 --> 13:03.000
into the fire alone to save you

13:03.000 --> 13:04.910
and burned one of his arms.

13:05.270 --> 13:07.580
Do you really want them to feel guilty,

13:08.000 --> 13:09.870
blame themselves, and live in regret

13:09.870 --> 13:12.080
for the rest of their lives
because of your death?

13:12.080 --> 13:13.510
Ask yourself.

13:14.360 --> 13:16.120
Do you truly feel no shame?

13:29.670 --> 13:30.670
Uncle Jingdong,

13:32.360 --> 13:33.440
after hearing what I said,

13:33.440 --> 13:35.000
if you still want to die,

13:36.240 --> 13:37.720
no one can stop you.

13:38.870 --> 13:40.030
Your life is

13:41.390 --> 13:42.720
yours to decide.

14:04.280 --> 14:04.960
Father.

14:06.840 --> 14:08.390
L-Let's go back.

14:10.320 --> 14:11.120
Zhengshen...

14:14.750 --> 14:17.210
Where did you get burned?
Let me check on you.

14:17.390 --> 14:18.000
I'm fine.

14:18.000 --> 14:18.960
Let me see.

14:18.960 --> 14:19.480
It's nothing.

14:19.480 --> 14:21.080
Show me.

14:33.630 --> 14:34.510
Does it hurt?

14:35.360 --> 14:36.490
It doesn't, Father.

14:40.030 --> 14:42.480
Sorry, I've made you

14:42.600 --> 14:45.150
and your mother suffer.

14:46.270 --> 14:47.720
I apologize

14:48.790 --> 14:50.270
to both of you.

14:50.270 --> 14:50.730
Father.

14:51.720 --> 14:52.320
Father.

14:58.030 --> 14:59.240
Get up, Jingdong.

15:02.670 --> 15:03.440
Ying.

15:03.960 --> 15:04.790
Jingdong,

15:05.720 --> 15:07.780
since you returned from the capital,

15:08.790 --> 15:10.030
crippled

15:11.870 --> 15:13.870
and broken in spirit,

15:15.030 --> 15:16.830
I've been waiting day and night.

15:18.060 --> 15:20.060
I've been waiting for you to recover

15:20.240 --> 15:21.840
and pull yourself together.

15:23.550 --> 15:27.150
I've waited for the whole 13 years
for you to sober up.

15:28.840 --> 15:30.960
If you really leave us behind,

15:32.670 --> 15:33.670
I will never let you go

15:33.670 --> 15:36.870
in this life, even if I
have to chase you to the underworld!

15:41.360 --> 15:46.120
It's my fault. I was wrong.

15:55.060 --> 15:58.490
[Li Ink]

16:06.320 --> 16:07.250
Uncle Jingdong,

16:08.440 --> 16:10.100
do you still want to die today?

16:11.480 --> 16:12.910
I've already died once.

16:14.600 --> 16:15.870
I can't die again.

16:17.630 --> 16:18.550
Zhen,

16:19.870 --> 16:22.130
I came here specifically to wait for you.

16:30.150 --> 16:31.480
After I woke up,

16:32.910 --> 16:33.910
Zhengshen

16:34.600 --> 16:36.120
told me everything

16:36.120 --> 16:38.250
that had happened in the past few days.

16:40.600 --> 16:42.060
You were right to scold me.

16:43.440 --> 16:44.360
Well scolded.

16:46.670 --> 16:48.120
Your words woke me up

16:50.120 --> 16:51.240
and brought me,

16:52.080 --> 16:53.740
a useless wreck, back to life.

17:04.589 --> 17:06.109
Uncle Jingdong, what are you doing?

17:06.109 --> 17:07.680
Get up quickly. Come on.

17:08.440 --> 17:09.349
Zhen,

17:10.780 --> 17:12.390
for all these years,

17:13.750 --> 17:16.480
I have treated you harshly
on various occasions.

17:17.960 --> 17:19.920
I owe you an apology.

17:21.440 --> 17:22.920
I was wrong.

17:25.069 --> 17:26.720
I made you suffer.

17:32.880 --> 17:35.280
When the Li family
was struck by a disaster,

17:35.480 --> 17:38.240
I should have been the one
to support the family.

17:39.160 --> 17:41.590
But I complained about everything,

17:42.480 --> 17:43.940
dwelled on my resentment,

17:44.720 --> 17:47.030
and left this whole mess to you.

17:48.920 --> 17:51.920
You were the one
who supported this family in my place.

17:53.000 --> 17:54.600
On behalf of the Sixth Branch

17:55.270 --> 17:56.350
and the Li family,

17:58.270 --> 17:59.680
thank you.

18:05.720 --> 18:06.850
It's all in the past.

18:08.550 --> 18:09.400
It's over now.

18:10.480 --> 18:11.070
Come on.

18:13.420 --> 18:14.420
Sit down, please.

18:25.880 --> 18:27.590
Fate is cruel.

18:31.640 --> 18:32.640
Your father,

18:34.200 --> 18:36.000
Jingyuan, and Jingqi,

18:36.920 --> 18:38.110
were

18:39.310 --> 18:41.440
far superior to me

18:42.680 --> 18:44.830
in both talent and character.

18:47.440 --> 18:49.790
Yet I am the one who survived.

18:54.510 --> 18:57.880
I failed to support this family for them

19:00.000 --> 19:01.920
or secure this business.

19:05.160 --> 19:06.590
I let them down.

19:11.640 --> 19:12.680
Uncle Jingdong,

19:13.790 --> 19:15.200
you can't say that.

19:15.440 --> 19:16.440
The past few days,

19:17.200 --> 19:19.750
I've visited all the regular clients

19:19.750 --> 19:20.920
of Li Ink.

19:21.240 --> 19:22.640
They all praised us,

19:23.000 --> 19:25.440
saying the quality of our ink is stable,

19:25.830 --> 19:28.680
and the delivery dates
have never been delayed.

19:29.640 --> 19:30.640
Over the years,

19:30.790 --> 19:33.510
you have been overseeing the ink delivery.

19:34.070 --> 19:36.680
You have supported this family very well.

19:36.680 --> 19:37.920
Not at all.

19:40.550 --> 19:43.440
I know exactly what I am capable of.

19:43.680 --> 19:45.400
Everyone has their own expertise.

19:45.400 --> 19:46.490
To maintain an ink workshop,

19:46.490 --> 19:48.930
relying solely on ink-making is
absolutely not enough.

19:48.930 --> 19:51.580
You also need
to deal with those ink merchants.

19:51.830 --> 19:54.200
In the past few days,
as the acting manager of the family,

19:54.200 --> 19:57.530
I have already seen
how unfathomable the business realm is.

19:57.830 --> 19:59.200
So, Uncle Jingdong,

19:59.680 --> 20:01.480
don't underestimate yourself.

20:02.640 --> 20:03.440
Now,

20:03.720 --> 20:05.960
the Tribute Ink selection is approaching.

20:05.960 --> 20:07.780
During the few days you were in a coma,

20:07.780 --> 20:09.510
Eldest Aunt handed this matter

20:09.680 --> 20:11.000
over to me to decide.

20:12.310 --> 20:13.270
But I know

20:13.960 --> 20:15.590
you've put years of effort into it

20:15.590 --> 20:18.850
through countless bitter winters
and scorching summers.

20:19.260 --> 20:20.790
So, regarding this matter,

20:21.550 --> 20:23.810
I can't make the decision on your behalf.

20:31.730 --> 20:36.770
[Invitation to the Ink Worship Ceremony]

20:37.350 --> 20:39.480
Lord Yan is holding
the ink worship ceremony.

20:39.480 --> 20:42.610
Has the Li family decided
whether to participate or not?

20:44.240 --> 20:45.370
I don't know either.

20:46.070 --> 20:47.350
But I guess

20:48.270 --> 20:49.000
they will.

20:49.320 --> 20:51.030
Li Ink has suffered disasters
over and over again,

20:51.030 --> 20:52.550
and it's a troubled time.

20:53.110 --> 20:55.000
Under such circumstances,

20:55.050 --> 20:57.450
if she still holds on without withdrawing,

20:57.960 --> 21:00.440
then Zhen really has guts.

21:02.880 --> 21:05.590
It is precisely because
of the repeated blows Li Ink has suffered

21:05.590 --> 21:06.750
and their low morale

21:06.960 --> 21:08.890
that I guess she will participate.

21:09.070 --> 21:10.310
This is exactly the perfect time

21:10.310 --> 21:12.440
to get everyone in Li Ink united as one.

21:13.440 --> 21:14.840
You really know her well.

21:16.880 --> 21:18.440
Sister.

21:19.310 --> 21:20.400
Fine.

21:20.400 --> 21:21.860
I won't tease you anymore.

21:29.160 --> 21:31.790
The invitation
to the Chen family's ink testing event?

21:31.790 --> 21:33.110
I heard that the Chen family

21:33.110 --> 21:34.680
also has a peerless ink this time

21:34.680 --> 21:36.720
to participate
in the Tribute Ink selection.

21:36.720 --> 21:37.510
So, Sister,

21:37.880 --> 21:40.640
as long as we invest
in both the Li and Chen Ink Workshops,

21:38.190 --> 21:39.740
[Dear Madam Wang]
[From Chen Ink, Chen Jiru]

21:40.640 --> 21:42.840
our chances of winning will be greater.

21:43.000 --> 21:46.110
This way, it won't delay
the important military supplies.

21:46.110 --> 21:47.770
So I'd like to ask you, Sister,

21:47.920 --> 21:49.450
to invest in the Chen family

21:49.590 --> 21:50.550
in your name.

21:51.400 --> 21:52.330
I will pay for it.

21:59.620 --> 22:01.310
You've considered it

22:01.790 --> 22:03.200
quite thoroughly.

22:05.440 --> 22:06.960
Okay, don't worry.

22:07.410 --> 22:08.540
I will do my best.

22:08.920 --> 22:10.200
But if we do this,

22:11.920 --> 22:13.720
how will you explain it to Li Ink?

22:16.590 --> 22:17.680
It's my duty.

22:17.850 --> 22:20.450
I believe Li Zhen will understand me.

22:21.870 --> 22:23.150
It's just that

22:23.240 --> 22:25.040
she will be under more pressure.

22:25.280 --> 22:28.370
[The memorial tablet
of my late father, Li Jinhe]

22:38.350 --> 22:41.510
Today is an auspicious day.

22:41.960 --> 22:44.480
We set up an altar for ink worship.

22:45.350 --> 22:49.110
Anyone wishing to participate
in the Tribute Ink selection

22:49.480 --> 22:50.940
must present the document

22:51.680 --> 22:53.810
and bow to the Founder's Black Banner.

23:16.220 --> 23:18.390
[Li Ink's Participation Document
for the Tribute Ink]

23:30.790 --> 23:33.190
No one
from the Li family is participating.

23:33.540 --> 23:35.270
It is considered a withdrawal.

23:37.440 --> 23:38.590
I hereby announce

23:39.410 --> 23:42.410
that it is now the auspicious time!

23:42.440 --> 23:44.170
Start the funeral procession!

23:50.680 --> 23:51.680
Father!

23:53.350 --> 23:56.200
Please rest in peace!

24:06.490 --> 24:08.840
Lift the coffin!

24:09.830 --> 24:11.310
Hold on, Lord Yan!

24:18.880 --> 24:20.280
Please hold on, Lord Yan.

24:20.680 --> 24:21.920
The auspicious time hasn't arrived.

24:21.920 --> 24:24.000
Please wait a moment, Lord Yan.

24:25.450 --> 24:27.650
Master Qi, what do you mean by this?

24:28.750 --> 24:30.960
It is currently the Xinwei hour.

24:31.350 --> 24:34.680
Xin represents Yin Gold,
and Wei represents Yin Earth.

24:34.920 --> 24:37.510
Xinwei means Earth generates Gold.

24:37.960 --> 24:39.790
Mutual generation is auspicious.

24:39.790 --> 24:41.350
It is indeed the auspicious hour.

24:41.350 --> 24:42.920
You're right, Lord Yan.

24:43.270 --> 24:44.480
From heaven's perspective,

24:44.480 --> 24:46.610
the Xinwei hour is an auspicious time.

24:46.720 --> 24:50.240
But for the ink, it is not.

24:53.310 --> 24:54.750
You are here today

24:55.350 --> 24:57.110
for ink worship.

24:57.510 --> 24:59.240
And the ink's element is Water.

24:59.580 --> 25:00.820
But the Xinwei hour

25:00.880 --> 25:02.540
contains an element of Earth.

25:02.540 --> 25:05.240
Earth restrains Water.
Mutual restraint is dangerous

25:05.240 --> 25:06.640
and detrimental to the ink.

25:06.640 --> 25:07.720
I hold the view

25:08.400 --> 25:11.200
that the Renshen hour is
the true auspicious time.

25:14.320 --> 25:16.210
Besides, Lord Yan,

25:16.360 --> 25:18.550
the Tribute Ink selection is
of great significance.

25:18.550 --> 25:19.640
I said this

25:19.720 --> 25:24.510
in the hope that the ink worship ceremony
could be timed

25:24.760 --> 25:26.160
and executed perfectly.

25:26.160 --> 25:28.750
I hope you will think twice, Lord Yan.

25:31.450 --> 25:34.200
Master Qi has got a point.

25:35.110 --> 25:37.440
Then everyone from the ink workshops and I

25:37.790 --> 25:39.030
will wait here for a while?

25:39.030 --> 25:43.090
Thank you for considering things
for the Huizhou ink industry, Lord Yan.

25:45.120 --> 25:46.860
My Lord, the Xinwei ink worship
was specifically calculated

25:46.860 --> 25:49.240
by some fortune-teller
hired by the Literary Association.

25:49.240 --> 25:50.680
You can't trust

25:50.680 --> 25:52.000
Qi Jiu's one-sided claim.

25:52.000 --> 25:54.440
Just now, every family
has presented their documents.

25:54.440 --> 25:57.840
If the ink worship ceremony is delayed
or interrupted again,

25:58.310 --> 26:01.040
I'm afraid the Founding Master
will be offended.

26:05.160 --> 26:05.960
Lord Yan.

26:06.000 --> 26:08.160
It is the auspicious time!

26:08.750 --> 26:10.350
Beat the drums!

26:22.310 --> 26:23.510
Bow!

26:24.920 --> 26:26.240
Kneel!

26:27.270 --> 26:28.640
Prostrate!

26:31.160 --> 26:32.470
Rise!

26:33.840 --> 26:35.690
The ceremony is complete!

26:35.720 --> 26:37.440
The Li family is late, sorry.

26:53.200 --> 26:53.960
Lord Yan,

26:54.450 --> 26:57.000
today is my father's funeral. So we're
late as the Li family's participants.

26:57.000 --> 26:58.110
Please,

26:58.680 --> 26:59.810
forgive us, my lord.

27:00.790 --> 27:02.030
In this case,

27:02.440 --> 27:06.770
the Li family doesn't intend to withdraw
from the Tribute Ink selection, huh?

27:06.830 --> 27:07.510
Indeed.

27:07.950 --> 27:09.350
Li Ink will participate.

27:10.960 --> 27:12.890
That's what I've been waiting for.

27:13.440 --> 27:14.640
Li Ink

27:15.030 --> 27:17.400
treats ink
with utmost passion and sincerity.

27:17.400 --> 27:18.830
Despite myriad difficulties,

27:18.830 --> 27:20.230
you will never back down.

27:34.550 --> 27:36.030
Bow!

27:38.270 --> 27:39.510
Kneel!

27:42.720 --> 27:44.030
Prostrate!

27:46.310 --> 27:47.640
Rise!

27:51.400 --> 27:52.640
Prostrate!

27:56.270 --> 27:57.510
Rise!

28:03.200 --> 28:04.400
Bow!

28:07.790 --> 28:09.160
Rise!

28:11.640 --> 28:13.540
The ceremony is complete!

28:25.440 --> 28:26.370
Uncle Jingdong,

28:26.520 --> 28:28.830
I've placed all your unburnt ink clumps

28:29.000 --> 28:30.480
right here for you.

28:30.590 --> 28:32.510
Manager Shao and Zhengshen

28:32.640 --> 28:33.960
helped gather them.

28:36.160 --> 28:36.790
Have a seat.

28:36.790 --> 28:37.400
Okay.

28:39.830 --> 28:43.200
These are all useless things.

28:44.550 --> 28:46.150
Thank you for your hard work.

28:51.240 --> 28:52.720
Using almonds as a preservative

28:52.720 --> 28:54.650
and adding borneol for fragrance,

28:54.750 --> 28:55.680
what a good idea.

28:57.550 --> 28:59.200
This ink is truly great.

28:59.590 --> 29:00.480
Zhen,

29:01.720 --> 29:03.440
I only knew before

29:03.640 --> 29:06.040
that you were very talented in ink-making.

29:06.160 --> 29:07.550
I didn't expect you to have reached

29:07.550 --> 29:10.550
the level of knowing the components
just by smelling.

29:11.030 --> 29:12.030
I was thinking,

29:13.820 --> 29:17.160
perhaps we should use Fu Jin Ink
for the Tribute Ink selection.

29:17.160 --> 29:19.110
It has already gained a reputation

29:19.240 --> 29:22.000
and cured Lord Yan's daughter.

29:22.030 --> 29:23.030
Uncle Jingdong,

29:23.310 --> 29:25.000
my Fu Jin Ink is a medicinal ink.

29:25.000 --> 29:27.270
It might not be suitable
for the Tribute Ink selection.

29:27.270 --> 29:28.110
Besides,

29:28.200 --> 29:29.790
you've put so much effort

29:29.790 --> 29:30.920
into this pine soot ink.

29:30.920 --> 29:32.450
How can you give up halfway?

29:35.830 --> 29:37.240
Let's refine it together.

29:37.240 --> 29:40.040
I believe it will definitely
turn out even better.

29:47.680 --> 29:48.550
Zhen,

29:49.920 --> 29:50.960
take this.

29:53.270 --> 29:54.270
What's this?

29:54.880 --> 29:57.270
This is the ink recipe
for top-grade pine soot ink

29:57.270 --> 29:59.350
collected by us, the Sixth Branch.

30:04.680 --> 30:06.210
By longstanding family rules,

30:06.210 --> 30:07.680
the ink recipe must not be passed
to outsiders.

30:07.680 --> 30:10.610
It is the foundation
of the ink workshop's survival.

30:11.000 --> 30:12.000
Uncle Jingdong,

30:12.270 --> 30:14.440
after all,
I haven't returned to the clan yet.

30:14.440 --> 30:15.510
This is inappropriate.

30:15.510 --> 30:17.960
If I say it's appropriate, then it is.

30:19.270 --> 30:21.960
Since you've let go of past grudges,

30:22.550 --> 30:24.830
how can I still be selfish?

30:26.030 --> 30:27.030
Besides,

30:27.160 --> 30:28.720
this ink recipe

30:29.070 --> 30:30.920
has become my inner demon,

30:31.000 --> 30:32.600
doing me more harm than good.

30:32.880 --> 30:35.110
If you can draw inspiration from it

30:35.270 --> 30:37.110
and add brilliance to the new ink,

30:37.110 --> 30:39.370
that would be a great blessing for Li Ink.

30:40.070 --> 30:43.310
If your Seventh Grandmother were awake,

30:44.130 --> 30:46.570
she would definitely support my decision.

30:52.000 --> 30:53.070
I promise I will

30:53.790 --> 30:54.790
give it my all.

31:03.490 --> 31:05.390
[Ink-Mixing Area]

31:10.920 --> 31:12.320
Please give it to me, sir.

31:12.370 --> 31:13.680
Come on, look.

31:13.720 --> 31:15.310
Didn't he just sweep it?

31:15.400 --> 31:16.640
Now there's none left.

31:16.640 --> 31:18.270
Put it back on again.

31:29.860 --> 31:31.820
No, it's still too thin.

31:31.850 --> 31:32.850
Make it thicker.

31:33.110 --> 31:34.440
T-This isn't that hard.

31:34.480 --> 31:36.480
It's pretty much like making pills.

31:38.110 --> 31:39.000
Shut up,

31:39.000 --> 31:40.530
or I'll hit you with my cane.

31:40.790 --> 31:43.640
Dad, I'll go practice ink-mixing again.

31:43.790 --> 31:44.920
I'll go practice it.

31:46.270 --> 31:47.270
You can keep burning.

31:47.270 --> 31:49.070
The oil soot hasn't stopped yet.

32:12.160 --> 32:13.090
Uncle Jingdong,

32:14.310 --> 32:15.720
I think we succeeded.

32:19.750 --> 32:21.440
Miss Li Zhen, Master,

32:21.640 --> 32:23.600
the Chen family sent an invitation
to the ink testing event,

32:23.600 --> 32:26.400
saying they've finalized
the ink for submission.

32:41.750 --> 32:42.480
Qi Jiu,

32:42.750 --> 32:44.790
Cuiqiao is also here.

32:45.460 --> 32:46.970
Did she invest in Chen Ink?

32:47.510 --> 32:48.110
Yes.

32:48.510 --> 32:49.830
I asked her to do it.

32:53.720 --> 32:54.920
Doing business needs

32:55.550 --> 32:57.210
to play both sides sometimes.

33:00.240 --> 33:02.240
It's just a deal. Just for business.

33:06.270 --> 33:07.930
This ink is indeed brilliant.

33:08.030 --> 33:11.030
This ink is bright but not gaudy,

33:11.510 --> 33:13.480
with distinct layers.

33:14.440 --> 33:15.640
The lingering charm

33:16.350 --> 33:17.790
is indescribable.

33:17.920 --> 33:18.980
Third Master Chen,

33:19.000 --> 33:22.480
your Chen family successfully produced
this lacquer-soot ink

33:22.480 --> 33:25.960
of such an extraordinary quality
before the Tribute Ink selection.

33:25.960 --> 33:27.510
It's truly not easy.

33:27.510 --> 33:29.160
You flatter us, my lord.

33:29.550 --> 33:30.680
We're flattered.

33:34.240 --> 33:35.160
Master Li.

33:37.270 --> 33:37.750
My lord.

33:37.750 --> 33:38.960
Come here.

33:39.350 --> 33:42.400
Check out this lacquer-soot ink
from the Chen family.

33:42.660 --> 33:45.700
See which one is better
compared to your Li family's

33:46.070 --> 33:47.750
ancient lacquer-soot ink.

33:48.830 --> 33:49.480
Yes.

34:13.630 --> 34:14.360
My lord,

34:16.480 --> 34:17.360
this ink...

34:18.630 --> 34:19.480
My lord,

34:20.400 --> 34:23.550
Hui Ink has not been listed
among all the trades since ancient times,

34:23.550 --> 34:25.000
but it holds a high status.

34:25.000 --> 34:27.710
All matters in the ink industry are always
managed by the Literary Association.

34:27.710 --> 34:29.770
Master ink makers are also scholars.

34:30.590 --> 34:31.650
And in literature,

34:32.000 --> 34:33.280
there is no absolute first place.

34:33.280 --> 34:35.000
The same goes for ink.

34:36.070 --> 34:36.960
I think,

34:37.070 --> 34:38.880
for every master ink maker,

34:39.000 --> 34:41.590
the ink they make themselves

34:41.670 --> 34:43.400
must rank first in their hearts.

34:43.400 --> 34:45.800
Just as the ancient lacquer-soot ink
of the Li family

34:45.800 --> 34:47.920
definitely ranks first in the hearts

34:48.320 --> 34:49.719
of Uncle Jingdong and me.

34:50.800 --> 34:52.330
Am I right, Uncle Jingdong?

34:54.489 --> 34:56.230
And this piece of ink from the Chen family

34:56.230 --> 34:58.590
must also be the first in the hearts

34:58.840 --> 35:00.760
of Third Grandfather Chen
and Uncle Junshan.

35:00.760 --> 35:01.890
Third Grandfather,

35:01.920 --> 35:03.380
does what I say make sense?

35:05.030 --> 35:06.510
Yes, it makes sense.

35:06.610 --> 35:09.020
What an eloquent girl!

35:14.280 --> 35:15.070
Lord Yan,

35:15.280 --> 35:16.340
Third Master Chen,

35:16.340 --> 35:19.140
since everyone is so interested
in this Cloud Ink,

35:19.280 --> 35:21.400
can we try this ink ourselves

35:21.480 --> 35:22.740
to see its brilliance?

35:23.360 --> 35:25.420
What do you think, Third Master Chen?

35:25.600 --> 35:27.550
You are all peers in the ink industry.

35:27.550 --> 35:28.710
Please feel free to give it a try.

35:28.710 --> 35:30.440
It's my honor.

35:30.840 --> 35:32.190
Thank you, Third Master Chen.

35:32.190 --> 35:32.820
Please.

35:43.960 --> 35:45.620
Clouds gather around the sun.

35:45.760 --> 35:47.150
The ink lives up to its name.

35:47.150 --> 35:48.630
Its color is as deep as the night,

35:48.630 --> 35:51.110
and its luster is as smooth as jade.

35:51.440 --> 35:52.280
Nice ink.

35:52.780 --> 35:54.180
It's really amazing ink.

35:55.670 --> 35:57.130
Eldest Young Master Tian,

35:57.200 --> 35:58.730
then I would also like to ask

35:59.110 --> 36:00.960
when I will have the honor to see

36:00.960 --> 36:03.510
the Tian family's ink for submission?

36:03.760 --> 36:04.510
Lord Yan,

36:07.000 --> 36:10.000
this is the newly made Styrax Ink
from the Tian family,

36:10.030 --> 36:11.670
which we intend
to submit for the Tribute Ink selection.

36:11.670 --> 36:12.710
Please evaluate it, my lord.

36:12.630 --> 36:13.660
[Styrax]

36:23.400 --> 36:24.460
Third Master Chen.

36:31.670 --> 36:32.430
Madam Wang.

36:36.030 --> 36:37.490
Eldest Young Master Tian,

36:37.550 --> 36:39.080
forgive me for being blunt.

36:39.760 --> 36:42.550
One of the standards

36:43.480 --> 36:47.280
for an excellent ink stick is
a pure scent.

36:47.480 --> 36:48.710
This ink

36:49.150 --> 36:50.400
has a vulgar scent

36:50.760 --> 36:52.510
and is made from complicated materials.

36:52.510 --> 36:55.590
Compared to the Chen family's Cloud Ink,

36:55.760 --> 36:57.630
it is inferior, I'm afraid.

37:00.320 --> 37:02.250
You are absolutely right, my lord.

37:02.840 --> 37:04.880
The Chen Ink has such a profound heritage.

37:04.880 --> 37:06.480
Our Tian family's Styrax Ink

37:06.840 --> 37:08.570
only looks good on the surface,

37:08.760 --> 37:10.690
but it's nowhere near good enough.

37:11.190 --> 37:12.190
I am so ashamed.

37:28.230 --> 37:29.000
Zhen,

37:29.800 --> 37:32.470
Tian Benchang is a cunning man.

37:33.070 --> 37:34.550
I guess the Styrax Ink he brought out

37:34.550 --> 37:37.680
at the ink testing event just now was
just a distraction.

37:38.510 --> 37:40.030
Given Tian Benchang's tricks,

37:40.030 --> 37:41.830
he definitely has a backup plan.

37:47.630 --> 37:48.360
Zhen,

37:48.880 --> 37:50.880
although I don't know how to make ink,

37:50.880 --> 37:51.550
I have...

37:51.710 --> 37:53.440
still evaluated various inks.

37:53.880 --> 37:56.670
The Chen family's Cloud Ink we saw
at the ink testing event just now

37:56.670 --> 37:58.530
was truly out of my expectations,

37:58.920 --> 38:00.650
showing great momentum to win.

38:01.030 --> 38:02.030
Are you really

38:02.280 --> 38:05.140
not going to submit the Fu Jin Ink
for the selection?

38:06.840 --> 38:07.880
In my opinion,

38:08.190 --> 38:10.850
the Fu Jin Ink
can only represent me personally.

38:11.110 --> 38:12.280
Yet the pine soot ink is

38:12.280 --> 38:14.880
the ink
that can truly represent the Li family.

38:15.280 --> 38:16.110
Moreover,

38:16.150 --> 38:18.150
in the current situation,
whether for Uncle Jingdong

38:18.150 --> 38:19.480
or the Li family,

38:20.030 --> 38:23.030
pulling it off together matters more
than the result.

38:23.730 --> 38:25.440
So, for this Tribute Ink selection,

38:25.440 --> 38:27.070
our Li family must participate,

38:27.070 --> 38:30.150
and we must use the ink
made by Uncle Jingdong.

38:30.760 --> 38:31.670
Only in this way

38:32.190 --> 38:33.440
can our Li family

38:33.960 --> 38:35.710
really get over it and move on.

38:36.550 --> 38:38.210
And the hearts of the Li family

38:38.230 --> 38:39.920
can start beating again.

38:40.800 --> 38:41.590
I see.

38:42.360 --> 38:45.320
Looks like you are
more insightful than I am.

38:48.110 --> 38:49.170
But what about you?

38:49.620 --> 38:50.940
You invested in our Li Ink

38:50.940 --> 38:53.070
to secure military funds for Marshal Qi.

38:53.070 --> 38:54.280
But this time,

38:54.920 --> 38:57.500
no one knows
who will win the Tribute Ink right.

38:57.500 --> 38:58.730
Aren't you afraid?

38:58.760 --> 38:59.590
It's okay.

38:59.710 --> 39:01.640
It's the same if Chen Ink is chosen.

39:05.670 --> 39:06.320
No, no.

39:06.920 --> 39:09.280
Don't get me wrong. I didn't mean that.

39:09.840 --> 39:10.840
I heard it clearly.

39:10.840 --> 39:12.190
That's exactly what you meant.

39:12.190 --> 39:13.150
You mean

39:13.150 --> 39:15.080
our Li Ink is not as good as Chen Ink.

39:15.160 --> 39:16.200
In that case,

39:16.230 --> 39:17.000
why don't you

39:17.360 --> 39:19.510
withdraw your shares from Li Ink

39:20.320 --> 39:22.320
and invest all the money in Chen Ink?

39:22.800 --> 39:23.760
No, no.

39:24.030 --> 39:26.110
Do not misunderstand me.

39:26.280 --> 39:28.150
A gentleman's word is his bond.

39:28.320 --> 39:29.670
And I've said before,

39:29.920 --> 39:31.840
it doesn't matter
even if you don't participate,

39:31.840 --> 39:34.070
because what I value is you, Zhen.

39:34.590 --> 39:35.480
Let me see.

39:36.030 --> 39:38.480
So this is what a gentleman looks like?

39:40.920 --> 39:42.150
Then take a closer look.

39:42.150 --> 39:44.190
A gentleman looks exactly like me.

39:48.880 --> 39:49.630
Zhen,

39:50.280 --> 39:51.760
it's still not too late

39:54.440 --> 39:55.640
to change the ink now.

39:57.320 --> 39:58.280
Uncle Jingdong,

39:58.760 --> 39:59.840
do you think

40:00.280 --> 40:02.080
there is a problem with this ink?

40:03.280 --> 40:04.480
Our ink

40:05.360 --> 40:07.000
is of excellent quality.

40:07.710 --> 40:09.770
But the only thing special about it is

40:10.630 --> 40:11.920
its deep black color.

40:12.480 --> 40:15.880
It's nowhere as good
as the Chen family's lacquer-soot ink.

40:17.150 --> 40:19.230
Let's change it to your Fu Jin Ink.

40:21.230 --> 40:23.880
Today, Tian Benchang was praising
the Chen Ink and belittling the Li Ink.

40:23.880 --> 40:26.360
He just attempted
to dampen our Li family's morale.

40:26.360 --> 40:27.320
Ignore him.

40:29.110 --> 40:31.030
But what he said is true.

40:31.280 --> 40:32.320
Uncle Jingdong,

40:32.400 --> 40:34.060
my Fu Jin Ink is medicinal ink.

40:34.270 --> 40:35.480
Let's not mention

40:35.590 --> 40:38.490
whether it complies with the rules
for the Tribute Ink selection.

40:38.490 --> 40:40.190
Even if we submit it for the selection,

40:40.190 --> 40:41.440
it might not win.

40:41.840 --> 40:43.550
But your pine soot ink

40:43.840 --> 40:45.110
is black enough,

40:45.360 --> 40:46.880
marking the original intention
of ink-making,

40:46.880 --> 40:49.880
completing the simplest thing
to the extreme extent.

40:50.150 --> 40:53.150
It's the most suitable
for the Ink Tribute selection.

40:54.070 --> 40:55.150
Do you still remember

40:55.150 --> 40:56.480
the ink you and my father

40:56.840 --> 40:58.700
made together for the first time?

41:01.880 --> 41:02.670
Jingfu,

41:02.780 --> 41:05.470
[Young Li Jingdong]

41:02.840 --> 41:05.360
what's so special about this ink of ours?

41:05.480 --> 41:07.360
Its color is black enough.

41:05.560 --> 41:07.280
[Young Li Jingfu]

41:07.670 --> 41:09.400
Do you still remember when we went to ask

41:09.400 --> 41:12.630
the scholars and tutors in the studies
along the Xuefu Street,

41:12.630 --> 41:14.070
as well as the shopkeeper

41:14.150 --> 41:16.210
of Sibao Restaurant on Sibao Street?

41:16.400 --> 41:17.190
Yes, I do.

41:17.440 --> 41:19.240
The students in the studies said

41:19.400 --> 41:20.670
that normally, when they used ink,

41:20.670 --> 41:22.190
it faded as they wrote.

41:22.360 --> 41:23.960
They always had to distract themselves
to grind more,

41:23.960 --> 41:25.480
which affected their concentration.

41:25.480 --> 41:26.440
The shopkeeper said

41:26.440 --> 41:28.360
he rarely used ink on Xuan paper.

41:28.440 --> 41:31.240
He often just jotted things down
on scratch paper.

41:31.360 --> 41:32.280
When in a hurry,

41:32.400 --> 41:35.760
he even wrote on his palms or arms.

41:35.960 --> 41:39.710
So, ink needs to be black enough
to be useful.

41:45.110 --> 41:46.480
Why did I forget?

41:48.670 --> 41:50.330
It turns out that this idea was

41:50.670 --> 41:52.150
planted in my head long ago

41:52.630 --> 41:54.320
by Jingfu.

41:57.590 --> 41:58.710
This ink

41:59.590 --> 42:01.630
carries my father's original intention,

42:01.630 --> 42:02.760
your persistence,

42:03.320 --> 42:05.650
the techniques my grandfather taught me,

42:05.840 --> 42:09.030
and the spirit passed down
through generations of Li Ink—

42:09.030 --> 42:11.670
embrace simplicity and benefit the world.

42:13.000 --> 42:14.280
But my Fu Jin Ink

42:14.510 --> 42:15.770
can only heal the body,

42:16.550 --> 42:18.230
while your pine soot ink

42:18.510 --> 42:20.070
represents the unity

42:20.070 --> 42:21.320
of the entire Li family.

42:21.320 --> 42:22.800
Furthermore, it's the supreme ink

42:22.800 --> 42:24.800
that Li Ink can present for now.

42:25.280 --> 42:27.740
It's perfect
for the Tribute Ink selection.

42:29.190 --> 42:31.510
Uncle Jingdong, you made this ink.

42:33.000 --> 42:34.360
Please give it a name.

42:36.070 --> 42:36.880
Zhen,

42:37.670 --> 42:39.150
you should be the one

42:39.440 --> 42:40.670
naming this ink,

42:41.030 --> 42:43.190
because you are the most qualified.

42:45.800 --> 42:46.400
Okay.

42:58.400 --> 42:59.550
"Origin Ink."

43:01.960 --> 43:02.630
Good.
